cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use evalnoise, please cite it as below."
title: evalnoise
abstract: >-
  Variance components of agent-eval scores (item, item x arm, run, item x run and
  within-run noise) from per-trial results, with honest intervals, and a planner for the
  number of tasks, repeats and runs a comparison needs to detect a given difference,
  validated by simulation.
type: software
authors:
  - name: h-a-forster
repository-code: "https://github.com/h-a-forster/evalnoise"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-07"
keywords:
  - llm evaluation
  - agent evaluation
  - variance components
  - power analysis
  - minimum detectable effect
